{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured persistent, source-preserving BGP transit through SONiC node1. Each Ubuntu peer originates exactly one endpoint /32, management remains separate, and all nodes recovered successfully after sequential restarts.","actions_performed":["Configured peer-a as node1 172.20.1.0/31 ↔ node2 172.20.1.1/31.","Configured peer-b as node1 172.20.2.0/31 ↔ node3 172.20.2.1/31.","Configured node2 AS 65101 to originate only 192.0.2.1/32.","Configured node3 AS 65102 to originate only 198.51.100.1/32.","Configured node1 AS 65100 with exact inbound/outbound prefix filters and IPv4 forwarding.","Added persistent address and FRR configuration services, including SONiC container-aware BGP restoration.","Restarted nodes sequentially and verified changed boot identities and full recovery.","Captured packet-level proof of unchanged endpoint source addresses in both directions."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Dedicated transit links with management outside the data plane","command_ids":["cmd-b94c6a103335445b","cmd-cd8bcf2aaf1c42d3","cmd-66edeb68ed3e4b06"],"summary":"Management remains on eth0/enp1s0, while BGP and endpoint traffic use only eth1/eth2 and enp8s0."},{"requirement":"Each Ubuntu peer originates only its stable endpoint prefix","command_ids":["cmd-cd8bcf2aaf1c42d3","cmd-66edeb68ed3e4b06"],"summary":"Advertised-route output shows node2 sending only 192.0.2.1/32 and node3 sending only 198.51.100.1/32; each session sends and receives exactly one prefix."},{"requirement":"node1 learns both routes and provides bidirectional transit","command_ids":["cmd-b94c6a103335445b","cmd-d50bcf9ed2934cba","cmd-a50c7625260947e3"],"summary":"node1 has both BGP routes installed through the correct dedicated interfaces, and endpoint-sourced probes succeed in both directions."},{"requirement":"Endpoint source addresses are preserved","command_ids":["cmd-67975455c16e41c0","cmd-ef8c2a79db2146f0"],"summary":"Packet captures on node1 show 192.0.2.1 ↔ 198.51.100.1 unchanged in both directions, with no translation."},{"requirement":"node1 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-601cc9057dbd4a4e","cmd-f47ea0cd37674c84","cmd-fe9ae9cdf0b84f09","cmd-7a86a0c78f8d4b6d"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, restored addressing/FRR sessions, exact routes, and working endpoint transit are proven."},{"requirement":"node2 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-9506de9fb0024b38","cmd-e374eb4153e1477f","cmd-cd8bcf2aaf1c42d3"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, restored service/address state, exact advertisement, route, and endpoint connectivity are proven."},{"requirement":"node3 restart persistence and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-ad4421c64d664758","cmd-afa23fa0c64f4df6","cmd-66edeb68ed3e4b06"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, restored service/address state, exact advertisement, route, and endpoint connectivity are proven."}]}
